# The mobile fork's in-game interface, loaded after benilla's layer when the client runs as the
# mobile client (crates/benilla-app/src/mobile). Every file is ours.

## Interface: 11200

# The options window's Mobile page and the desktop rows a phone has no use for.
MobileOptions.xml
# The touch controls: the jump ring, the menu button and its radial menu, the views and the layout
# editor.
MobileControls.xml
# The game controller's cursor, layer bindings and Controller Buttons screen.
MobilePad.xml
# The assists: what a finger is on, the context button, smart targeting, haptics and the safe area.
MobileAssist.xml
